sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title Open a template detail page
  participant V as Visitor
  participant W as Web App
  participant A as Express API
  participant S as Supabase
  V->>W: Open /template/:slug
  W->>A: GET /api/templates/:slug
  A->>S: findPublished(slug)
  S-->>A: template row
  A->>S: fetchTaxonomy()
  S-->>A: taxonomy
  A-->>W: 200 hydrated template
  W-->>V: Render preview, metadata and download action
  Note over A: A missing or unpublished slug returns 404.
